# Operational append-only ledgers. NEVER commit content.
# Bootstrap rows live in MAKHZAN; live rows are strict_local or
# review_before_commit (depends on ledger; see NIZAM_TEMPLE#ledgers).
*.jsonl
# Advisory-lock sidecars created by governor/ledger_writer.py. Zero-byte,
# per-host, recreated on demand: a lock is runtime state, never content.
*.jsonl.lock
*.merkle
*.sth
# Signed Tree Heads expose ledger size/timing metadata for strict_local
# ledgers whose payload is never pushed — keep the anchors local too.
*.sth.json
sth/
# Integration-test receipt (paths + counts) — local artifact, do not push.
T1_receipt.json
!.gitignore
!README.md
!schemas/
